Resource Description:
Understanding the full scale of potential impacts from current and future electricity generation is required, in order to avoid “impact leakage”, i.e. increasing non-climate environmental pressure
 while reducing greenhouse gas emissions. Life cycle assessment allows the evaluation of a product over its life cycle,
 and across a wide range of environmental indicators – this method was chosen to report on the environmental profiles of various technologies.

